edical Coding Specialist as their program in Fall 2026 and 21 students have=
 it as their program in Fall 2027?
*       In the Student Level report, is it showing each student with the li=
sted program for each term?  Ex. Taylor Koxelka has an academic map for Aut=
o Collision Repair for Fall 2026?  Is this possible even though we are not =
offering the program this year?
*       How would you recommend we use the Program Level and Student Level =
reports?



I=92d like to talk to Cynde about you and I joining a Deans meeting to revi=
ew these reports. Would you be open to that?



Thanks again,

Holly





